  "timeframe": "2026-11-24T18:07:00Z/2026-11-24T19:07:00Z (last hour, 1-minute periods where possible), compared against the prior hour baseline",
  "criteria": "Look for ThrottlingException / 429 / ServiceQuotaExceeded / ModelTimeout / ModelErrorException / 5xx / AccessDenied in runtime logs and non-zero InvocationThrottles / client / server error metrics. Also note the model IDs and inference profiles in use and any service quota constraints (tokens/requests per minute) if throttling is seen. Return concise findings with concrete counts and timestamps, and state clearly if no throttling or errors were found or if data could not be found."
}"}, "type": "tool_use", "display_intent": "Check Bedrock throttling and errors for search agent runtime"}], "created_at": null}

